  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DAI 2016 Kvinder&#xe5;det</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme development objective is to prevent and combat violence against women through sustainable networks and institutions (DAPP Thematic Area: women&apos;s empowerment and gender equality).

The immediate objectives of the programme are as follows:
- strengthening the preparedness for handling VAW in public and private spheres. Increased capacity of women&apos;s shelters and other organizations in the field of VAW in the MENA region
- Raising awareness about women&apos;s rights. Awareness raising on VAW among community leaders and opinion makers to break the taboo regarding domestic violence
- Strengthening VAW related knowledge, mutual understanding, information and advocacy through dialogue, networking and exchange of experiences between Danish and MENA partners</narrative>
  </description>
